[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2522.95, "timestamp": "00:42:02", "text": "Mel。 梅尔不是正确的方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2526.55, "timestamp": "00:42:06", "text": "显而易见的方法才是正道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2528.87, "timestamp": "00:42:08", "text": "好了，我们走吧。 我刚才说到哪儿了？ 哦，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2531.67, "timestamp": "00:42:11", "text": "好多了。 什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2535.03, "timestamp": "00:42:15", "text": "目标失败。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2537.109, "timestamp": "00:42:17", "text": "什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2538.79, "timestamp": "00:42:18", "text": "你是为了我才把这个丢的吗？ 好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2540.63, "timestamp": "00:42:20", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2542.87, "timestamp": "00:42:22", "text": "那是个不错的盾牌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2545.589, "timestamp": "00:42:25", "text": "好的，看来你的任务已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2548.47, "timestamp": "00:42:28", "text": "过期了。 我们仍然可以去完成我们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2551.75, "timestamp": "00:42:31", "text": "任务。 我的任务其实在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2553.03, "timestamp": "00:42:33", "text": "保持警惕。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2556.79, "timestamp": "00:42:36", "text": "。 哦，是的。 另外，我还有这个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2559.43, "timestamp": "00:42:39", "text": "你看，这个叫做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2562.39, "timestamp": "00:42:42", "text": "坐标数据板的东西。 把它捡起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2563.03, "timestamp": "00:42:43", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2564.79, "timestamp": "00:42:44", "text": "所以，你需要两个这个。 下一个就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2566.79, "timestamp": "00:42:46", "text": "那边。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2569.43, "timestamp": "00:42:49", "text": "它离我执行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2572.39, "timestamp": "00:42:52", "text": "任务的目的地很近。 呃，你需要两张这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2574.63, "timestamp": "00:42:54", "text": "卡，然后就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2576.47, "timestamp": "00:42:56", "text": "生成一个有很多"}, {